cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below, together with the companion manuscript."
type: dataset
title: "CowTail-4: A Tail-Mounted Nine-Axis IMU Behaviour Dataset for Dairy Cattle"
version: "1.0"
license: CC-BY-4.0
license-url: "https://github.com/jiaosir-cow/cowtail/blob/main/LICENSE"
repository-code: "https://github.com/jiaosir-cow/cowtail"
url: "https://github.com/jiaosir-cow/cowtail"
abstract: >-
  Tail-root behaviour data for the companion manuscript's ten usable cows.
  The four reported test cattle, cowA–cowD, have raw nine-axis streams and
  12,736 model windows. Six further animals, released as train1–train6, supply
  additional training data only: 101 intervals and 879 three-axis windows.
  Behaviour classes are standing, lying, walking and feeding.
keywords:
